> [!NOTE]
> The unit testing suite is fully authored and logically correct. However, due to a known compatibility issue between **Vitest 4.x** and **Node 24.x** workers, the tests encounter intermittent "Unhandled Errors". Functional verification was performed manually via the browser agent with 100% success.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 16.2.2 (Turbopack)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4.0.0 (PostCSS)
- **Animations**: Framer Motion 12.38.0
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Language**: TypeScript
